# API contracts (nwk1 ↔ apollo ↔ athena)

Tokens are **hardcoded in PHP**, not env vars. Prefer changing them in the cited files on both sides together. Most nwk1→apollo curls set `CURLOPT_SSL_VERIFYHOST/PEER = 0`. Apollo→nwk1 polling uses **verify on**.

