## Error / redirect patterns

- nwk1 dashboard: empty apollo body → fake completed error state (progress 100, `contactError`).
- apollo `process.php`: HTML `Location:` back to `system.bbimarketing.com/new/queries/*_direct_mail.php?id=&status=success|error`.
- Shared-secret mismatch: 401 text or 400 JSON. No OAuth between these hosts.
